{"id":"forecast-11","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-11/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":379.51,"segments":[{"start":0.3,"end":9.18,"text":"Section 3. You will hear two primary school trainee teachers called Stefan and Magda discussing","words":[["Section",0.3,0.94],["3.",0.94,1.42],["You",2.36,2.74],["will",2.74,2.92],["hear",2.92,3.2],["two",3.2,3.56],["primary",3.56,4.14],["school",4.14,4.54],["trainee",4.54,5.04],["teachers",5.04,5.66],["called",5.66,6.4],["Stefan",6.4,6.96],["and",6.96,7.64],["Magda",7.64,8.18],["discussing",8.18,9.18]]},{"start":9.18,"end":15.66,"text":"their placements for science teaching. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["their",9.18,9.6],["placements",9.6,10.3],["for",10.3,10.6],["science",10.6,10.98],["teaching.",10.98,11.48],["First,",12.44,13.4],["you",14.02,14.2],["have",14.2,14.38],["some",14.38,14.58],["time",14.58,14.9],["to",14.9,15.1],["look",15.1,15.2],["at",15.2,15.36],["questions",15.36,15.66]]},{"start":15.66,"end":53.42,"text":"21 to 26 on page 6. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["21",15.66,16.42],["to",16.42,16.68],["26",16.68,17.28],["on",17.28,18.12],["page",18.12,18.42],["6.",18.42,18.9],["Now",49.12,49.62],["listen",49.62,49.88],["carefully",49.88,50.36],["and",50.36,51.08],["answer",51.08,51.4],["questions",51.4,51.78],["21",51.78,52.62],["to",52.62,52.86],["26.",52.86,53.42]]},{"start":56.88,"end":58.94,"text":"Hi Magda, how was your placement?","words":[["Hi",56.88,57.36],["Magda,",57.36,57.78],["how",58.18,58.4],["was",58.4,58.52],["your",58.52,58.62],["placement?",58.62,58.94]]},{"start":59.6,"end":64.0,"text":"It went really well. The kids really enjoyed the science I did with them.","words":[["It",59.6,59.78],["went",59.78,59.96],["really",59.96,60.34],["well.",60.34,60.76],["The",61.3,61.46],["kids",61.46,61.66],["really",61.66,62.1],["enjoyed",62.1,62.58],["the",62.58,62.8],["science",62.8,63.16],["I",63.16,63.46],["did",63.46,63.6],["with",63.6,63.8],["them.",63.8,64.0]]},{"start":64.32,"end":67.14,"text":"So did mine. I think they found it very motivating.","words":[["So",64.32,64.52],["did",64.52,64.68],["mine.",64.68,64.98],["I",65.56,65.74],["think",65.74,65.9],["they",65.9,66.04],["found",66.04,66.28],["it",66.28,66.4],["very",66.4,66.64],["motivating.",66.64,67.14]]},{"start":67.64,"end":73.36,"text":"Yes, the programme we had to teach was much better than the old style science experiments","words":[["Yes,",67.64,68.12],["the",68.58,68.84],["programme",68.84,69.28],["we",69.28,69.54],["had",69.54,69.72],["to",69.72,69.9],["teach",69.9,70.24],["was",70.24,70.46],["much",70.46,70.78],["better",70.78,71.18],["than",71.18,71.38],["the",71.38,71.52],["old",71.52,71.74],["style",71.74,72.18],["science",72.18,72.66],["experiments",72.66,73.36]]},{"start":73.36,"end":74.38,"text":"we did at school.","words":[["we",73.36,73.68],["did",73.68,73.9],["at",73.9,74.08],["school.",74.08,74.38]]},{"start":74.96,"end":79.04,"text":"Yes, though I don't understand why the children should have to build a model of a steam","words":[["Yes,",74.96,75.3],["though",75.52,75.66],["I",75.66,75.82],["don't",75.82,75.98],["understand",75.98,76.44],["why",76.44,76.74],["the",76.74,76.86],["children",76.86,77.26],["should",77.26,77.48],["have",77.48,77.66],["to",77.66,77.82],["build",77.82,78.06],["a",78.06,78.2],["model",78.2,78.5],["of",78.5,78.68],["a",78.68,78.78],["steam",78.78,79.04]]},{"start":79.04,"end":82.72,"text":"engine. I tried it with the kids, but I couldn't get it to work.","words":[["engine.",79.04,79.46],["I",80.0,80.36],["tried",80.36,80.56],["it",80.56,80.7],["with",80.7,80.78],["the",80.78,80.9],["kids,",80.9,81.2],["but",81.44,81.74],["I",81.74,81.86],["couldn't",81.86,82.08],["get",82.08,82.2],["it",82.2,82.32],["to",82.32,82.46],["work.",82.46,82.72]]},{"start":82.72,"end":87.58,"text":"Me neither, and it really shows it's hard to get any real results.","words":[["Me",82.72,83.4],["neither,",83.4,83.9],["and",84.22,84.64],["it",84.64,84.76],["really",84.76,85.06],["shows",85.06,85.44],["it's",85.44,85.74],["hard",85.74,85.96],["to",85.96,86.16],["get",86.16,86.26],["any",86.26,86.52],["real",86.52,86.92],["results.",86.92,87.58]]},{"start":87.78,"end":93.04,"text":"Yes, and it's usually the children's parents, rather than the kids themselves, who favour","words":[["Yes,",87.78,88.0],["and",88.54,88.9],["it's",88.9,89.08],["usually",89.08,89.38],["the",89.38,89.56],["children's",89.56,90.12],["parents,",90.12,90.6],["rather",90.96,91.24],["than",91.24,91.48],["the",91.48,91.6],["kids",91.6,91.82],["themselves,",91.82,92.32],["who",92.6,92.72],["favour",92.72,93.04]]},{"start":93.04,"end":96.88,"text":"that type of experiment. So what experiments did you do?","words":[["that",93.04,93.28],["type",93.28,93.54],["of",93.54,93.66],["experiment.",93.66,94.18],["So",95.12,95.5],["what",95.5,95.66],["experiments",95.66,96.18],["did",96.18,96.5],["you",96.5,96.7],["do?",96.7,96.88]]},{"start":97.44,"end":104.26,"text":"Well, one day a discussion started in class about breakfast cereals, about which one","words":[["Well,",97.44,97.9],["one",98.52,98.9],["day",98.9,99.24],["a",99.24,99.42],["discussion",99.42,99.82],["started",99.82,100.38],["in",100.38,100.68],["class",100.68,100.92],["about",100.92,101.38],["breakfast",101.38,101.98],["cereals,",101.98,102.86],["about",103.24,103.62],["which",103.62,103.98],["one",103.98,104.26]]},{"start":104.26,"end":108.56,"text":"was best. One child then said that we should test them in class.","words":[["was",104.26,104.46],["best.",104.46,104.9],["One",105.56,105.9],["child",105.9,106.24],["then",106.24,106.62],["said",106.62,106.94],["that",106.94,107.16],["we",107.16,107.32],["should",107.32,107.52],["test",107.52,107.82],["them",107.82,108.06],["in",108.06,108.22],["class.",108.22,108.56]]},{"start":108.56,"end":109.7,"text":"That's a nice idea.","words":[["That's",108.56,109.12],["a",109.12,109.2],["nice",109.2,109.4],["idea.",109.4,109.7]]},{"start":110.1,"end":112.1,"text":"Yes, and it wasn't expensive.","words":[["Yes,",110.1,110.42],["and",110.9,111.14],["it",111.14,111.24],["wasn't",111.24,111.5],["expensive.",111.5,112.1]]},{"start":112.78,"end":118.58,"text":"We brought four different brands of cereal and had everyone evaluate them for taste, appearance","words":[["We",112.78,112.92],["brought",112.92,113.2],["four",113.2,113.62],["different",113.62,113.96],["brands",113.96,114.38],["of",114.38,114.56],["cereal",114.56,114.98],["and",114.98,115.54],["had",115.54,115.74],["everyone",115.74,116.1],["evaluate",116.1,116.6],["them",116.6,116.98],["for",116.98,117.22],["taste,",117.22,117.74],["appearance",118.12,118.58]]},{"start":118.58,"end":120.52,"text":"and sogginess in milk.","words":[["and",118.58,119.24],["sogginess",119.24,119.84],["in",119.84,120.18],["milk.",120.18,120.52]]},{"start":121.08,"end":123.14,"text":"And are you going to tell me which one won?","words":[["And",121.08,121.52],["are",121.52,121.72],["you",121.72,121.82],["going",121.82,121.96],["to",121.96,122.1],["tell",122.1,122.3],["me",122.3,122.44],["which",122.44,122.64],["one",122.64,122.92],["won?",122.92,123.14]]},{"start":123.52,"end":125.92,"text":"No, I'll let you do it yourself.","words":[["No,",123.52,123.96],["I'll",124.46,124.78],["let",124.78,124.92],["you",124.92,125.08],["do",125.08,125.24],["it",125.24,125.36],["yourself.",125.36,125.92]]},{"start":126.66,"end":128.98,"text":"It obviously isn't difficult to set up.","words":[["It",126.66,126.88],["obviously",126.88,127.28],["isn't",127.28,127.78],["difficult",127.78,128.16],["to",128.16,128.4],["set",128.4,128.62],["up.",128.62,128.98]]},{"start":129.6,"end":135.88,"text":"Another experiment we did, the sports teacher's idea actually, was to spend a morning seeing","words":[["Another",129.6,130.16],["experiment",130.16,130.78],["we",130.78,131.06],["did,",131.06,131.3],["the",131.86,132.02],["sports",132.02,132.44],["teacher's",132.44,133.02],["idea",133.02,133.24],["actually,",133.24,133.76],["was",134.18,134.54],["to",134.54,134.7],["spend",134.7,134.9],["a",134.9,135.14],["morning",135.14,135.42],["seeing",135.42,135.88]]},{"start":135.88,"end":143.42,"text":"how high various balls bounced. For example, do new tennis balls bounce higher than old","words":[["how",135.88,136.2],["high",136.2,136.74],["various",136.74,137.28],["balls",137.28,137.78],["bounced.",137.78,138.48],["For",139.08,139.34],["example,",139.34,139.88],["do",140.44,140.7],["new",140.7,141.12],["tennis",141.12,141.44],["balls",141.44,141.92],["bounce",141.92,142.36],["higher",142.36,142.82],["than",142.82,143.1],["old",143.1,143.42]]},{"start":143.42,"end":148.74,"text":"ones? And do basket balls that are fully inflated bounce better than flatter ones?","words":[["ones?",143.42,143.8],["And",144.24,144.46],["do",144.46,144.64],["basket",144.64,145.06],["balls",145.06,145.46],["that",145.46,145.72],["are",145.72,145.9],["fully",145.9,146.16],["inflated",146.16,146.84],["bounce",146.84,147.32],["better",147.32,147.72],["than",147.72,147.96],["flatter",147.96,148.34],["ones?",148.34,148.74]]},{"start":149.04,"end":154.3,"text":"And I guess you got some interesting data? We did, and they had to make a chart to plot","words":[["And",149.04,149.38],["I",149.38,149.56],["guess",149.56,149.84],["you",149.84,150.06],["got",150.06,150.22],["some",150.22,150.4],["interesting",150.4,150.78],["data?",150.78,151.16],["We",151.54,151.76],["did,",151.76,152.04],["and",152.52,152.72],["they",152.72,152.88],["had",152.88,153.04],["to",153.04,153.16],["make",153.16,153.32],["a",153.32,153.48],["chart",153.48,153.86],["to",153.86,154.1],["plot",154.1,154.3]]},{"start":154.3,"end":161.4,"text":"the results. It really improved their grasp of charts and graphs and calculation. Apparently","words":[["the",154.3,154.46],["results.",154.46,154.84],["It",155.54,155.68],["really",155.68,156.12],["improved",156.12,156.7],["their",156.7,156.92],["grasp",156.92,157.4],["of",157.4,157.66],["charts",157.66,158.08],["and",158.08,158.46],["graphs",158.46,158.9],["and",158.9,159.26],["calculation.",159.26,160.14],["Apparently",160.88,161.4]]},{"start":161.4,"end":165.08,"text":"Recently they'd had problems understanding the point of graphs in the past.","words":[["Recently",161.4,161.52],["they'd",161.52,161.86],["had",161.86,162.04],["problems",162.04,162.54],["understanding",162.54,163.26],["the",163.26,163.5],["point",163.5,163.78],["of",163.78,164.0],["graphs",164.0,164.28],["in",164.28,164.54],["the",164.54,164.66],["past.",164.66,165.08]]},{"start":165.7,"end":167.8,"text":"Did all your experiments work out okay?","words":[["Did",165.7,166.02],["all",166.02,166.22],["your",166.22,166.38],["experiments",166.38,166.86],["work",166.86,167.18],["out",167.18,167.42],["okay?",167.42,167.8]]},{"start":168.34,"end":172.52,"text":"Well, we had one lesson on making paper from grass.","words":[["Well,",168.34,168.94],["we",169.22,169.44],["had",169.44,169.76],["one",169.76,170.16],["lesson",170.16,170.68],["on",170.68,170.88],["making",170.88,171.24],["paper",171.24,171.76],["from",171.76,172.06],["grass.",172.06,172.52]]},{"start":173.18,"end":175.98,"text":"The children made a terrible mess in the classroom.","words":[["The",173.18,173.32],["children",173.32,173.64],["made",173.64,173.98],["a",173.98,174.18],["terrible",174.18,174.72],["mess",174.72,175.14],["in",175.14,175.36],["the",175.36,175.46],["classroom.",175.46,175.98]]},{"start":176.66,"end":180.7,"text":"Whatever they did didn't work, and it wasn't because it was difficult.","words":[["Whatever",176.66,177.04],["they",177.04,177.3],["did",177.3,177.6],["didn't",177.6,178.06],["work,",178.06,178.36],["and",178.86,179.1],["it",179.1,179.22],["wasn't",179.22,179.52],["because",179.52,179.8],["it",179.8,180.02],["was",180.02,180.16],["difficult.",180.16,180.7]]},{"start":181.38,"end":184.46,"text":"I think it was because it didn't engage them at all.","words":[["I",181.38,181.62],["think",181.62,181.9],["it",181.9,182.12],["was",182.12,182.28],["because",182.28,182.56],["it",182.56,182.76],["didn't",182.76,183.08],["engage",183.08,183.64],["them",183.64,184.02],["at",184.02,184.16],["all.",184.16,184.46]]},{"start":184.94,"end":187.1,"text":"It didn't seem to motivate them.","words":[["It",184.94,185.22],["didn't",185.22,185.62],["seem",185.62,185.84],["to",185.84,186.1],["motivate",186.1,186.7],["them.",186.7,187.1]]},{"start":187.58,"end":190.04,"text":"My tie-dying experiment went well.","words":[["My",187.58,188.18],["tie",188.18,188.56],["-dying",188.56,188.84],["experiment",188.84,189.48],["went",189.48,189.72],["well.",189.72,190.04]]},{"start":190.04,"end":195.08,"text":"material. They had to get a piece of material and twist it into a rope and then dye it.","words":[["material.",190.04,190.1],["They",190.36,190.84],["had",190.84,191.0],["to",191.0,191.14],["get",191.14,191.24],["a",191.24,191.38],["piece",191.38,191.62],["of",191.62,191.8],["material",191.8,192.32],["and",192.32,192.84],["twist",192.84,193.18],["it",193.18,193.42],["into",193.42,193.62],["a",193.62,193.82],["rope",193.82,194.08],["and",194.08,194.46],["then",194.46,194.62],["dye",194.62,194.88],["it.",194.88,195.08]]},{"start":195.66,"end":199.08,"text":"The children did end up with blue and green hands for a few days, though.","words":[["The",195.66,195.88],["children",195.88,196.2],["did",196.2,196.5],["end",196.5,196.66],["up",196.66,196.8],["with",196.8,196.98],["blue",196.98,197.28],["and",197.28,197.4],["green",197.4,197.64],["hands",197.64,198.14],["for",198.14,198.3],["a",198.3,198.42],["few",198.42,198.54],["days,",198.54,198.8],["though.",198.9,199.08]]},{"start":199.64,"end":202.44,"text":"But don't you need to spend more than one lesson on that?","words":[["But",199.64,199.92],["don't",199.92,200.26],["you",200.26,200.4],["need",200.4,200.54],["to",200.54,200.72],["spend",200.72,200.98],["more",200.98,201.32],["than",201.32,201.48],["one",201.48,201.66],["lesson",201.66,202.0],["on",202.0,202.2],["that?",202.2,202.44]]},{"start":202.94,"end":208.6,"text":"Yes, we did it over three classes. The children really loved it, though, and one suggested","words":[["Yes,",202.94,203.28],["we",203.4,203.52],["did",203.52,203.64],["it",203.64,203.76],["over",203.76,203.98],["three",203.98,204.32],["classes.",204.32,204.84],["The",205.54,205.86],["children",205.86,206.26],["really",206.26,206.68],["loved",206.68,207.02],["it,",207.02,207.18],["though,",207.2,207.36],["and",207.66,207.92],["one",207.92,208.14],["suggested",208.14,208.6]]},{"start":208.6,"end":214.24,"text":"we make scarves from the result. I declined, as my sewing skills aren't up to much.","words":[["we",208.6,208.9],["make",208.9,209.12],["scarves",209.12,209.86],["from",209.86,210.02],["the",210.02,210.16],["result.",210.16,210.56],["I",211.22,211.5],["declined,",211.5,211.88],["as",212.28,212.46],["my",212.46,212.62],["sewing",212.62,213.0],["skills",213.0,213.42],["aren't",213.42,213.7],["up",213.7,213.84],["to",213.84,213.96],["much.",213.96,214.24]]},{"start":214.24,"end":221.5,"text":"I guess the one experiment that everyone loved in my class was making glue from milk. I thought","words":[["I",214.24,214.94],["guess",214.94,215.18],["the",215.18,215.4],["one",215.4,215.66],["experiment",215.66,216.24],["that",216.24,216.52],["everyone",216.52,216.86],["loved",216.86,217.52],["in",217.52,217.82],["my",217.82,218.02],["class",218.02,218.44],["was",218.44,218.96],["making",218.96,219.28],["glue",219.28,219.72],["from",219.72,220.04],["milk.",220.04,220.44],["I",221.04,221.3],["thought",221.3,221.5]]},{"start":221.5,"end":227.34,"text":"it would be a complete failure but in fact it worked brilliantly. One reason I suspect","words":[["it",221.5,221.68],["would",221.68,221.78],["be",221.78,221.96],["a",221.96,222.08],["complete",222.08,222.46],["failure",222.46,223.12],["but",223.12,223.36],["in",223.36,223.52],["fact",223.52,223.86],["it",223.86,224.06],["worked",224.06,224.36],["brilliantly.",224.36,225.2],["One",225.92,226.32],["reason",226.32,226.66],["I",226.66,226.94],["suspect",226.94,227.34]]},{"start":227.34,"end":232.8,"text":"is that they got feedback straight away. Some children get really restless if they have","words":[["is",227.34,227.76],["that",227.76,227.94],["they",227.94,228.12],["got",228.12,228.34],["feedback",228.34,228.94],["straight",228.94,229.48],["away.",229.48,229.92],["Some",230.54,230.8],["children",230.8,231.22],["get",231.22,231.46],["really",231.46,231.74],["restless",231.74,232.16],["if",232.16,232.52],["they",232.52,232.66],["have",232.66,232.8]]},{"start":232.8,"end":237.2,"text":"to wait for anything interesting to happen. Yes, I think that's always a good idea.","words":[["to",232.8,232.9],["wait",232.9,233.22],["for",233.22,233.46],["anything",233.46,233.7],["interesting",233.7,234.32],["to",234.32,234.64],["happen.",234.64,234.94],["Yes,",235.32,235.58],["I",235.74,235.84],["think",235.84,236.0],["that's",236.0,236.26],["always",236.26,236.56],["a",236.56,236.76],["good",236.76,236.86],["idea.",236.86,237.2]]},{"start":237.68,"end":239.26,"text":"Really helps to make it a success.","words":[["Really",237.68,238.04],["helps",238.04,238.34],["to",238.34,238.5],["make",238.5,238.68],["it",238.68,238.78],["a",238.78,238.88],["success.",238.88,239.26]]},{"start":239.26,"end":239.44,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",239.26,239.44]]},{"start":242.68,"end":248.36,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 27","words":[["Before",242.68,243.26],["you",243.26,243.54],["hear",243.54,243.78],["the",243.78,243.94],["rest",243.94,244.22],["of",244.22,244.36],["the",244.36,244.46],["discussion,",244.46,244.94],["you",245.58,245.86],["have",245.86,246.04],["some",246.04,246.24],["time",246.24,246.62],["to",246.62,246.84],["look",246.84,246.98],["at",246.98,247.14],["questions",247.14,247.38],["27",247.38,248.36]]},{"start":248.36,"end":274.61,"text"