.99],["of",293.99,294.13],["metal.",294.13,294.41],["Right.",294.75,295.23],["And",295.69,296.07],["that",296.07,296.43],["holds",296.43,296.77],["the",296.77,297.03],["hot",297.03,297.21],["water.",297.21,297.59],["That's",298.05,298.39],["right.",298.39,298.63],["And",299.05,299.27],["it",299.27,299.39],["has",299.39,299.53],["a",299.53,299.65]]},{"start":299.65,"end":306.09,"text":"strainer which sits inside it. This is where you put the plant matter. We use plants like","words":[["strainer",299.65,300.15],["which",300.15,300.55],["sits",300.55,300.77],["inside",300.77,301.29],["it.",301.29,301.53],["This",302.21,302.61],["is",302.61,302.73],["where",302.73,302.89],["you",302.89,303.01],["put",303.01,303.19],["the",303.19,303.33],["plant",303.33,303.73],["matter.",303.73,304.11],["We",304.87,305.17],["use",305.17,305.43],["plants",305.43,305.77],["like",305.77,306.09]]},{"start":306.09,"end":311.99,"text":"rosemary, as the essence you can extract is quite strong. So what's the container right","words":[["rosemary,",306.09,306.65],["as",307.01,307.37],["the",307.37,307.55],["essence",307.55,307.77],["you",307.77,308.03],["can",308.03,308.15],["extract",308.15,308.57],["is",308.57,308.83],["quite",308.83,309.11],["strong.",309.11,309.57],["So",310.13,310.57],["what's",310.57,311.03],["the",311.03,311.15],["container",311.15,311.67],["right",311.67,311.99]]},{"start":311.99,"end":318.03,"text":"at the top? It's made of glass. It's where we put the ice. The glass container has","words":[["at",311.99,312.21],["the",312.21,312.29],["top?",312.29,312.57],["It's",313.13,313.39],["made",313.39,313.53],["of",313.53,313.67],["glass.",313.67,314.05],["It's",314.77,314.99],["where",314.99,315.13],["we",315.13,315.25],["put",315.25,315.41],["the",315.41,315.59],["ice.",315.59,315.83],["The",316.57,316.83],["glass",316.83,317.09],["container",317.09,317.65],["has",317.65,318.03]]},{"start":318.03,"end":324.25,"text":"a drip tip at the bottom. What's that for? It's where the essence collects. Where does","words":[["a",318.03,318.13],["drip",318.13,318.43],["tip",318.43,318.73],["at",318.73,319.07],["the",319.07,319.17],["bottom.",319.17,319.51],["What's",319.99,320.55],["that",320.55,320.77],["for?",320.77,321.09],["It's",321.57,321.93],["where",321.93,322.11],["the",322.11,322.29],["essence",322.29,322.53],["collects.",322.53,322.99],["Where",323.73,324.03],["does",324.03,324.25]]},{"start":324.25,"end":330.71,"text":"the essence go then? Into the dish at the bottom. It's made of pottery. Sounds good. I might","words":[["the",324.25,324.45],["essence",324.45,324.73],["go",324.73,325.03],["then?",325.03,325.33],["Into",325.83,326.15],["the",326.15,326.31],["dish",326.31,326.57],["at",326.57,326.69],["the",326.69,326.75],["bottom.",326.75,327.07],["It's",327.65,327.83],["made",327.83,327.99],["of",327.99,328.13],["pottery.",328.13,328.47],["Sounds",329.11,329.47],["good.",329.47,329.77],["I",330.37,330.55],["might",330.55,330.71]]},{"start":330.71,"end":338.84,"text":"try it with my class. That is the end of section 3. You now have","words":[["try",330.71,331.01],["it",331.01,331.15],["with",331.15,331.27],["my",331.27,331.47],["class.",331.47,331.79],["That",335.22,335.72],["is",335.72,335.9],["the",335.9,336.04],["end",336.04,336.26],["of",336.26,336.4],["section",336.4,336.7],["3.",336.7,337.22],["You",338.06,338.34],["now",338.34,338.58],["have",338.58,338.84]]},{"start":338.84,"end":374.39,"text":"half a minute to check your answers. Now turn to section 4 on page 8.","words":[["half",338.84,339.12],["a",339.12,339.24],["minute",339.24,339.5],["to",339.5,339.94],["check",339.94,340.26],["your",340.26,340.5],["answers.",340.5,340.9],["Now",371.39,371.73],["turn",371.73,372.01],["to",372.01,372.17],["section",372.17,372.47],["4",372.47,372.97],["on",372.97,373.63],["page",373.63,373.93],["8.",373.93,374.39]]}]}